1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
We are Orbital Farming, from Chihuahua, Mexico.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Our challenge: Field Shift, adapting farms with NASA data.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,600
Before you plant, see the water you are committing.

4
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:10,000
Beyond crop selection: water, soil, seasons and evidence.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,800
NASA data, a crop-water model, an answer per field.

6
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:15,200
Set the water allocation. The map and the indicator respond.

7
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:17,600
Each option: water required, hectares covered, years committed.

8
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:20,000
Satellite observations of this field, year by year.

9
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,400
Looking ahead: open data could serve any irrigation district.

10
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:29,000
The farmer decides.
